sequenceDiagram
  participant T1 as Thread 1
  participant L as Latch word (0 = free)
  participant T2 as Thread 2
  T1->>L: compare-and-swap(0, 1)
  T2->>L: compare-and-swap(0, 1)
  L-->>T1: success, word is now 1
  L-->>T2: fail, word was already 1
  Note over T2: spin and retry, or sleep
  T1->>L: store 0 to release
  T2->>L: compare-and-swap(0, 1)
  L-->>T2: success
